CC0 continuous body skin (epic #15150, #15299).

`body_skin_cc0.npz` is derived, by `build_body_skin.py` with
`skin_settings.json`, from MakeHuman files that are all CC0 1.0
(public-domain dedication); see `../head_cc0/LICENSE.CC0.txt` and
`../head_cc0/SOURCE_LICENSE_STATEMENT.txt`. `PROVENANCE.json` lists the
SHA-256 of every source file and morph target read.

Source repository: https://github.com/makehumancommunity/makehuman
Source commit: a8bc2d54ff0ac92e78ff71431b1023eda42bf482

